#: ../../source/chapters/10-claude-code.md:7 854fac5807164073a73e401febf39030
msgid "Case Study: Claude Code via《马书》"
msgstr "案例研究：通过《马书》看 Claude Code"

#: ../../source/chapters/10-claude-code.md:9 12a54988e4a540bb80db945700d8db37
msgid ""
"*The only closed-source case study in this book. Read it knowing that.*"
msgstr "*本书中唯一一份闭源案例。带着这一点去读。*"

#: ../../source/chapters/10-claude-code.md:11 a79de58739154cf689d98d7d917dd6ca
msgid "Reverse-Engineering Disclaimer"
msgstr "逆向工程免责声明"

#: ../../source/chapters/10-claude-code.md:13 0c29fa7e6aaa475d8fa9f8e846644ea2
msgid ""
"The Claude Code product is closed source. This chapter's analysis relies on "
"three evidence classes, in descending order of authority:"
msgstr "Claude Code 产品是闭源的。本章的分析依赖三类证据，按权威性递减排列："

#: ../../source/chapters/10-claude-code.md:16 b88614b8fad54f0abc1276c9039462a4
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Anthropic's official public documentation and launch post** "
"{cite}`anthropic2024claudecode` and the MCP specification "
"{cite}`anthropic2024mcp` — primary authority."
msgstr ""
"**Anthropic 的官方公开文档与发布文章** {cite}`anthropic2024claudecode` 以及 MCP 规范 "
"{cite}`anthropic2024mcp` —— 第一权威。"

#: ../../source/chapters/10-claude-code.md:19 5cb0978d9c074a40be35ee7341f23e35
msgid ""
"**Observed runtime behaviour** of the Claude Code CLI across the 2026-03 "
"through 2026-04 observation window on macOS and Linux, captured in author "
"session logs."
msgstr ""
"**运行时实测行为**：作者在 2026-03 到 2026-04 的观察窗口里，在 macOS 与 Linux 上运行 Claude Code "
"CLI，记入会话日志的观察结果。"

#: ../../source/chapters/10-claude-code.md:22 8d72aa3ff548413c9e05a67fe0f156f9
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Zhang Handong's《马书》 2026 reverse-engineering analysis** "
"{cite}`zhangbook2026` — hereafter *Ma's book* — a publicly available "
"Chinese-language study of Claude Code's bundled prompt, skill library, hooks"
" contract, and tool schemas."
msgstr ""
"**张汉东《马书》2026 年的逆向工程分析** {cite}`zhangbook2026` —— 下文称 *马书* "
"——一份公开发行的中文研究，系统拆解了 Claude Code 的内置提示、技能库、hooks 契约与工具 schema。"

#: ../../source/chapters/10-claude-code.md:27 5f96e0fd328b4892bbc5a545dfb5cd81
msgid ""
"**Observation window.** All claims below reflect Claude Code's behaviour "
"between **2026-03-01 and 2026-04-15**. Behaviour outside this window is not "
"guaranteed to match."
msgstr ""
"**观察窗口。** 下文所有结论只反映 Claude Code 在 **2026-03-01 到 2026-04-15** "
"之间的行为。此窗口之外的行为不保证一致。"

#: ../../source/chapters/10-claude-code.md:31 fb71efb85aa34b78a0c4f6d61d3564e0
msgid ""
"**Retraction commitment.** If Anthropic publishes official documentation or "
"makes a public statement that contradicts any claim below, this chapter will"
" be updated within 30 days and the retracted claim will be struck through "
"with a dated note explaining the change. The book treats reverse-engineered "
"observation as *provisional*, not authoritative."
msgstr ""
"**撤回承诺。** 若 Anthropic 发布官方文档或公开声明与下文任一结论冲突，本章将在 30 "
"天内更新，并把被撤回的结论划掉，附上注明日期的说明。本书把逆向观察视为 *临时性* 结论，而非权威结论。"

#: ../../source/chapters/10-claude-code.md:37 3ca741460f344214b4338dc89409dcfa
msgid ""
"**Licensing.** Neither《马书》 nor Claude Code's internal bundle is reproduced "
"verbatim in this chapter beyond the standard fair-use excerpt limit of ≤ 20 "
"lines per quoted passage, with attribution to《马书》's page numbers where "
"applicable."
msgstr ""
"**版权。** 本章不会原样转载《马书》或 Claude Code 的内部捆绑内容，单段引用不超过合理使用上限的 20 行，在可能处标注《马书》页码。"

#: ../../source/chapters/10-claude-code.md:42 73f5ce8d2ae540cf801ae357cde43678
msgid "§10.1 — Reading Claude Code through the matrix"
msgstr "§10.1 —— 用三大护法 × 四区域矩阵来读 Claude Code"

#: ../../source/chapters/10-claude-code.md:44 63cbfe97761140a7964fe1ffa4662ea4
msgid ""
"Claude Code, as observed and as described by《马书》, distributes harness "
"responsibility across three overlapping surfaces:"
msgstr "如实测所见、并被《马书》所记载：Claude Code 把挽具职责，分布在三个彼此重叠的表面上："

#: ../../source/chapters/10-claude-code.md:47 ec183bbb88af4655aa8d7246173ea9c4
msgid ""
"**The bundled system prompt** (Bridle, primarily SDD) — a multi-kilobyte "
"document that《马书》 reproduces and annotates across several chapters; it "
"includes role framing, tool-use heuristics, citation formatting rules, and "
"explicit red-flag self-questions."
msgstr ""
"**内置系统提示**（缰绳，主要是 SDD）—— 一份数 KB "
"的长文档；《马书》跨多章复刻并批注过它；里面包含角色设定、工具使用的启发式规则、引用格式、以及显式的\"红旗自问清单\"。"

#: ../../source/chapters/10-claude-code.md:51 b62ae81967fc4db38f37a5dcf7118314
msgid ""
"**The hooks contract** (Fence, spanning TDD and MDD) — `hooks.json` under "
"`.claude/` supports `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`, `SessionEnd`, and "
"`UserPromptSubmit` matchers; a non-zero exit code from a `PreToolUse` hook "
"refuses the tool call."
msgstr ""
"**hooks 契约**（护栏，横跨 TDD 与 MDD）—— `.claude/hooks.json` 支持 "
"`PreToolUse`、`PostToolUse`、`SessionEnd`、`UserPromptSubmit` "
"几类匹配器；`PreToolUse` 钩子以非零退出码结束，就会拒掉那次工具调用。"

#: ../../source/chapters/10-claude-code.md:55 de26be0c762d42d88bcd111dbfcea71f
msgid ""
"**The skills system** (Bridle + Paddock, mostly SDD) — `SKILL.md` files "
"under `~/.claude/skills/` the agent auto-discovers and invokes based on the "
"`description:` front-matter."
msgstr ""
"**技能系统**（缰绳 ＋ 牧场，主要是 SDD）—— `~/.claude/skills/` 下的 `SKILL.md` 文件，智能体根据 "
"front-matter 里的 `description:` 自动发现并调用。"

#: ../../source/chapters/10-claude-code.md:59 f2f4285056b94c21aa51cfac6b9f5140
msgid ""
"A compact excerpt from《马书》's observation of the bundled prompt (original is "
"Chinese; translation is the author's own for exposition):"
msgstr "以下是《马书》对内置提示的一段简短摘录（原文为中文；为便于叙述，译文由作者自行翻译）："

#: ../../source/chapters/10-claude-code.md:62 533508e0ef914f3aa120913357282a1f
msgid ""
"[Excerpt, ≤ 20 lines, translated from《马书》 Chapter 4, §4.2, p. 113]\n"
"\n"
"System message tail:\n"
"    - When asked a factual question, cite at least one source.\n"
"    - When writing code, prefer edits over creation.\n"
"    - Never include a generated-by-AI signature in the output.\n"
"    - If a skill applies, read and follow it before answering.\n"
"    - Treat user files as authoritative; do not overwrite without confirmation.\n"
msgstr ""
"[摘录，≤ 20 行，译自《马书》第 4 章 §4.2，p. 113]\n"
"\n"
"系统消息尾部：\n"
"    - 被问到事实性问题时，至少引用一处来源。\n"
"    - 写代码时，优先\"修改\"而非\"新建\"。\n"
"    - 输出中绝不要包含\"由 AI 生成\"的落款。\n"
"    - 若有 skill 适用，作答之前先读并遵循它。\n"
"    - 把用户文件视作权威；未确认之前不覆盖。\n"

#: ../../source/chapters/10-claude-code.md:73 8334a0ab1ec546efa9a7abd430009f99
msgid ""
"《马书》 argues — and observed behaviour corroborates — that these tail-of-"
"prompt rules are the single most load-bearing SDD × Bridle artefact in the "
"product."
msgstr "《马书》主张——实测行为也佐证——这些\"提示尾部规则\"是本产品里最承重的那一件 SDD × 缰绳 制品。"

#: ../../source/chapters/10-claude-code.md:77 99c3726dfe1245b8a473b60a8cb5e9b2
msgid "§10.2 — 12-cell highlight map with confidence bands"
msgstr "§10.2 —— 十二格亮点图（含置信等级）"

#: ../../source/chapters/10-claude-code.md:79 1b0c3edfe1574449a50ed8946928cf10
msgid ""
"Every cell below carries a confidence band: `observed` (directly verifiable "
"in runtime behaviour), `inferred` (derived from《马书》 + official docs + "
"observation triangulated), or `speculative` (best-guess that future "
"disclosure could promote or retract)."
msgstr ""
"下表每一格都标注一条置信等级：`observed`（直接可在运行时行为中复现）、`inferred`（由《马书》＋ 官方文档 ＋ 实测三角印证推得）、或"
" `speculative`（当前是最佳猜测，未来的官方披露可能把它升级或推翻）。"

